window.products.push({"id":1014100,"name":"Classic Turkish Towels - Luxury Towel Set for Bathroom, 100% Turkish Cotton, Quick Dry, Soft and Absorbent Bath Towels, Hand Towels, and Washcloths, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Kn6xRhNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious Towel Set - Enjoy the quality of hotel and spa towels in the comfort of your home with this bathroom towel set made of 100% Turkish cotton. Super Absorbent - The high-quality cotton material allows for maximum absorbency. These towels dry quickly between uses and are perfect for drying your body, hands, and face. Longevity & Comfort - Our 600 GSM towels feel ultra-soft and plush while remaining thick and durable for long-term use. They’re OEKO-TEX certified and chemical free. 6-Piece Set - Includes 2 large bath towels (30 x 54 inches), 2 hand towels (16 x 27 inches), and 2 washcloths (12 x 12 inches). Care Tips - To extend the longevity of your luxury towel set, machine-wash in warm or cold water. Always wash before first use to improve absorbency and softness. Avoid bleach and fabric softener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Kn6xRhNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Turkish Towels","source_asin":"B07PCTN4KC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PCTN4KC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PCTN4KC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1014101,"name":"Honeydew Queen Side Pillow Case - Fits The Scrumptious and Essence Curved Pillows for Side Sleeping - Comfortable and Soft Cooling Bamboo Fabric - Que","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dTnHM0YRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️COZY COMFORT: Made with 100% organic bamboo, our cases sleep cooler and are stronger than cotton. The hidden zipper closure ensures the pillow case always fits your pillow perfectly. The best sleep of your life is waiting for you- wake up feeling truly refreshed and rejuvenated! Go ahead and give in to comfort. Made with love, made for you. 🗽 AMERICAN MADE: Made by hand in California, our soft pillow cases won't wrinkle while you sleep. They perfectly fit our Scrumptious and Essence side pillows (the best pillows for side sleepers and neck pain). Our pillow for neck and shoulder pain has been featured in many popular publications such as: Forbes, Very Well Health, Wellness Magazine, Apartment Therapy, Popular Science, Allure, The Strategist, The Sleep Advisor, New York Magazine, The Snooze Expert, and Sleep Sherpa. ☑️FITS THE SCRUMPTIOUS: The Scrumptious Side Pillow features a gentle curve to naturally support your neck & shoulders whether you sleep on your side or on your back. Our pillows offer proper neck alignment & support so you can enjoy a deeper, more restful sleep. The Scrumptious Side Sleeper pillow for neck pain may provide relief like you've never felt before. The more rested you are, the brighter you can shine. This pillowcase also enhances its feel so you can rejuvenate yourself! ✅FITS THE ESSENCE: The Essence Side Pillow from Honeydew is soft & plush, yet supportive & substantial. Our sleeping pillows are made with materials that will never flatten out! Our high quality & luxurious pillows provide the ultimate in support while you sleep cool throughout the night. You're not at your best when you're tired or after a poor night's rest. Sleep is the ultimate luxury- give your bed a much needed makeover, and wake up refreshed & ready to face the day! ☁️ LIKE SLEEPING ON A CLOUD: We've put our heart & soul into every one of our handcrafted cases for our foam pillow. We believe in the power of sleep & we know we can make lives better. You deserve a peaceful night, full of deep slumber without pain & discomfort. Our side sleeping pillow & pillow case was specifically designed to work for YOU. The stars have aligned so that your body can too - getting the best sleep of your life is just a Honeydew pillow away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dTnHM0YRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honeydew","source_asin":"B09X68SX3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X68SX3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X68SX3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
