window.products.push({"id":1014129,"name":"Great Loom Cotton Super Thin Beach Towels Set of Three XL 36 x 67 Inches. Ultra Thin Towel, Turkish Towel, Peshtemal. Fuchsia, Dark Red, Grey Stripes ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1Kcxad2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thank you for considering our Towels. Great Loom We are established on the principle of making our customers happy and going above and beyond for your satisfaction. We always aim to bring you the best quality at affordable prices. We source our towels from Turkey's Aegean zone which is the historic origin of the Turkish Towel. The Ageless Style of a Tradition They are produced by individual local artisans on handlooms and bear anonymous patterns that evolved through their long history. With their recent popularity, they have become even more colorful. The elegant nature of these towels is already discovered by celebrities and we'd like to invite you to join the trend of minimalist beauty. Empowering Rural Women The global interest in this tradition made the local government incentivize the production and enabling rural women to participate and balance the male-centric economy of the region. Our Towels Natural 100% pure premium cotton XLarge at 36 x 67 inches Soft , perfect for babies and sensitive skin Versatile , use the beach, pool, as a shawl, sarong or a yoga towel Perfect for Travel , extremely thin and weigh only 0.4 pounds, fits in anywhere They dry very quickly and you can shake off the sand easily to keep your carry bags clean, mold & odor-free. We pre-wash the towels, they won't shrink, arrive soft, and ready to use in a beautiful box. Guarantee of Satisfaction We have a %100 refund policy for any reason, no questions asked. Great Loom is a young company standing by the quality of our towels. We have listened to your feedback and applied it to our new selection, storage, and packaging process. We'd like to hear about your feedback or complaints and will do our best to make you happy. Buy now with confidence and please let us know what you think.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r1Kcxad2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Loom","source_asin":"B08G8M6H3L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8M6H3L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8M6H3L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
