window.products.push({"id":1014268,"name":"Kyraton Water Pitcher with Removable Lid 51oz/1.5L, Hot and Cold Beverages Clear Glass Pitcher, Easy Clean Heat Resistant Borosilicate Glass Jug for T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M0wKAy9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: Handcrafted from heat-resistant borosilicate glass. This premium carafe is lead and cadmium free, BPA free, non-toxic, and the premium material makes it thicker, stronger and scratch resistant than other glass products. No Drip Spout and Ergonomic Handle: With this kettle you can easily pour and control the amount of water, so you can accurately pour every drop into the cup without wetting the table;The ergonomic handle makes it more comfortable to hold, and it doesn't get hot to prevent hot hands, so you can use this glass jug to make hot beverages with confidence! For All Beverages: The jug made of high-quality borosilicate glass is very heat-resistant, which means you can use it to store not only cold but also hot beverages, perfect for pouring hot tea, hot cocoa, iced tea, Fruit tea, juice, soda, milk, coffee, lemonade, wine, etc., and you can also put it in the refrigerator for storage. Classic Design: The maximum capacity of this carafe is 1500ML, the clean and simple lines are pleasing to the eye, and the crystal clear glass carafe can be perfectly matched with any decoration in your home, suitable for daily family life and cafes, teahouses, restaurants, hotels, etc. occasion use. Easy to Clean: Not only is this glass carafe microwave and stovetop safe, but all of its components are dishwasher safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M0wKAy9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kyraton","source_asin":"B0BDSP4DFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDSP4DFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDSP4DFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1014269,"name":"Essence Collection, Premium Quality, Soft, Wrinkle & Fade Resistant, Easy Case, Oversized Quilt Cover Set with 1 Quilt Set and 2 Shams, King/Californi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NfUdTtJML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber Imported Looking to update your bedroom with a Quality Product without Spending a lot of money? Our quilt sets fit the bill. These light-weight Quilt sets are High-Quality, beautifully embroidered with free-motion pattern and comes with matching sham to complete the set. These quilt sets are made with our signature Easy Care, breathable, Light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage free and fade resistant.  You will wake up fresh and well rested. High Quality Craftsmanship & Signature Soft Fabric:  Woven with 100% Double-Brushed 110 GSM Microfiber and will continue to soften with each wash. There are so many ways these quilts can be used. You can layer it to add depth, or you can simply use it on its own, these are light-weight and do not feel heavy. Quilt has tight stitching and will last you for a very long time. See our warranty details below. KING / CALIFORNIA KING Size is a 3-Piece Set and Contains One Quilt: 98x 108, Two Shams: 20 in wide x 36 in long. Quilt Set is made with our Signature Vilano 110 GSM Brushed Microfiber and the filling is Polyester 120 GSM. Shams are quilted on both sides. The Quilt Set comes in a bag That is beautifully designed and can be used to store other similar weight items. Easy Care & Fade Resistant:   Our Quilts are Fade and Pilling Resistant.  They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time.  And yes, they also are Wrinkle Resistant.   These Quilt Sets are high-quality and made with our Signature Top of the line quality 110 GSM (grams per square meter) Double-Brushed Luxurious microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness, while most sheets are made with 75 – 90 GSM. 30-DAY RISK-FREE GUARANTEE: Our products are high quality & we back them up with a Risk & worry-free 30-day guarantee. If you are not satisfied for any reason, you can contact us to discuss return or refund options. Plus, our 1-year warranty against any defects gives you one less thing to worry about. When you purchase a Southshore product, you are not just purchasing an exceptional quality home textile product, you are getting an absolute commitment on unmatched customer service as well.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NfUdTtJML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B08GF83KDM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GF83KDM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GF83KDM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
