window.products.push({"id":1014486,"name":"Brisica Digital Kitchen Timer, ON/Off Switch, 12/24 Hour Clock and Silent Timers, Count Up & Count Down for Kids Teachers Cooking Games Office, Large ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BigQL-XtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Multi-Function Timer】Brisica digital cooking timer clock has three modes (timer mode for count up and down, clock mode and alarm clock mode), you can just press mode button to change mode, easy to operate. Meet your various needs. 【Silent mode and ring mode】Available for more situations, we all dread the situation where our timer rings in the middle of a meeting, class or sound sensitive environments, mute & Flash mode is the solution of that problem. And ring mode with 70-90db loud beeping sound ensures you hear the alarm in another room, No worry about overcook. 【Three Ways to Place the Timer】The kitchen timers backing with UPGRADED 3 stronger magnetic, perfect to use on metal surface. Like refrigerator, the timer has stand on the back, you can place them on desk, also our timer included a extra neck lanyard, perfect use for sports or hanging on your kitchen hooks, Don't worry about the falling problems that often occur with other brands timers. 【User-Friendly Design】ON/OFF switch: saving your battery life; memory function: no need to set up the time every time; fast forward function: Set free your fingers, No need to hit m button 59 times To set 59 minute. Ideal for special needs, like children, parents, teachers, office staff/professionals, and students. 【After Sales Service】One year Hassle-Free replacement or Money back, If you have any quality issues or concerns please message us via Amazon, we will do our best to solve it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BigQL-XtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brisica","source_asin":"B08RSGNT91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RSGNT91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RSGNT91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1014487,"name":"Raveel 100pcs Mylar Bags, Mylar Bags for food Storage with 100 Oxygen Absorbers & 100 Labels,Resealable Mayler Food Bags Ziplock Storage Bags,Free Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WcpkoO+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Raveel Mylar bag has a matte White Smooth texture, aluminum foil, BPA , foodgrade material, which is durable, resealable, keeps all water out, and resistant to tear. The set includes oxygen absorbers for food storage and stickon labels. The large mylar bags zipper design can be used repeatedly, which is Comfortable and Convenient for foods that are often eaten. Sealable with iron or heatsealing machine for longterm food storage. These resealable mylar bags can heat sealable, Please make sure to close the zipper seal tight to prevent leakage. The mylar food bags Loud Lock smellproof baggies/zip lock bags are great to be used as candy packaging, mylar food storage bags, food packaging, foil bags, prepping supplies, packaging bags, and so much more! Raveel Mylar Bags for food Storage and oxygen absorbers are suitable for storing all kinds of food, such as dehydrated food, zedried products, grains, rice, beans, candies, oats, spice, nuts, cookies, tea, dried fruit, coffee beans, chips, cereal, rice, pasta, jewelry, makeup, wax melt, dog treat, etc. You can take the mylar food storage bags to anywhere or anyplace like a picnic, camping, BBQ, etc. Set includes 100 Packs gallon mylar bags including 3Different sizes 25 pcs ( 10''x 15''), 35pcs (7''x 10''), 40pcs (4''x 6''), 100 packets oxygen absorbers and 100 pieces of sticker labels. Note: The film bag is not a vacuum pack so the oxygen absorber only will remove all the oxygen from your bags to preserve your food longer, it is unable to remove all the air from your film bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WcpkoO+OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raveel","source_asin":"B0B56YMKQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B56YMKQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B56YMKQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
