window.products.push({"id":1014628,"name":"Acfruits Dried Pampas Grass Decor, 85Pcs 17.5 Inch Natural Pampas Grass Bouquet, Dried Flowers Bouquet Bunny Tail Grass Eucalyptus Fluffy for Vase Boh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yx8GhvaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"“Tranquil Countryside”: You will get a 85pcs real bouquet includes 10 bouquets of white Pampas, 25 bouquets of natural rabbit tail grass, 3 bouquets small Eucalyptus, 14 bouquets of natural Pampas, 20pcs reed grass, 4pcs brown pampas, 5 pcs yellow billy, 2 pcs wheat stalks, 2pcs white fruits. Fits Any Vase: Our beautiful pampas grass decor is about 17.5 inches/45cm tall, for decoration farmhouse/wedding/boho wall/bathroom/office/kitchen/wedding. You also can shorten the length of the pampas grass bouquet to adapt to your vase, so as to achieve your satisfactory decoration needs. Creating fullness and an interesting texture for your boho home decor. Let you enjoy the fun of DIY and feel the real natural atmosphere. A Gift From Nature: Natural pampas grass dried flowers are made of 100% natural high-quality dried flowers, non-toxic and harmless, and can be combined freely. Unlike fresh flower arrangements, once the feathers are conditioned, they require no maintenance. Divide different bohemian flowers into different vases, which can be placed in different environments, enjoy the fun of DIY projects, and add natural texture fun, which is a must for life. Warm Tips: Please take it apart carefully and shake the pampas grass. Since pampas are natural flowers and are shipped compressed, you will notice a little feather shedding when you take them out, which is normal but does not change the final look of the bouquet. Insert into a vase and let it dry in the sun for 4-6 hours, or use a hairdryer to restore it to a fluffy state. You can also spray with a natural and gentle styling hairspray to prevent it from falling out. Bohemian Decoration: Pampus Grass Home Decor Dried Short Flower Natural Bouquet Bulk Are Ideal As A Gift For Valentine'S Day, Christmas, Birthdays, Mother'S Day.You Can Choose This Natural Pampas Grass Dried Plant home decor For Yourself Or Your Family And Friends As Gift Of Eternal Love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yx8GhvaFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acfruits","source_asin":"B0BJ2J7HFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ2J7HFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ2J7HFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
