window.products.push({"id":1014639,"name":"ROJASOP 8-Tier Shoe Rack for Entryway, 25-28 Pairs Heavy-Duty Shoe Rack for Closet with Side Hooks Large Tall Shoe Rack Storage Organizer Metal Stacka","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l4OXX2S2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LARGE CAPACITY 8 TIERS Tall SHOE RACK】The large shoe rack Size: 33.4\"(L) x 12\"(W) x 53.6\"(H). Black 8-Tires shoe rack can stores up to 26(max 30) pairs adult shoes, enough for you and your family's daily life.Suitable for all kinds of shoes, from loafers and boots to heels and flip-flops and is perfect at your home, in office or dorm room. 【Sturdy Material& Stable Structure】The tall shoe rack is made of premium strengthened PP connectors and 13mm diameter sturdy metal tubes with smooth coating which is corrosion-resistant and dustproof, durable and prevent rusting, this metal shoe rack can hold much heavier and more durable during use.\" 【SPACE SAVING UNIQUE DESIGN】ROJASOP shoe rack organizer can be used to store not only shoes, but also clothes, bags, books, accessories, bedding and liners, CDs and DVDs, toys, and more. Very suitable for put in your entryway, closet, cabinet, wardrobe, living room, or garage. The shoe rack also has extra 2 rows of hooks, you can hang clothes, bags and umbrellas etc.Shoe organizers can make your space more beautiful and tidy. 【Easy to Assemble】The installation tools include detailed instructions, connectors, hooks, hammers, please lay out all components according to the marked number then start to assemble, easy and quick. It is worth noting that each plastic diaphragm and connector needs to be tightly connected together, make it firmly with our hammer. Tips: Due to thermal expansion and contraction, in cold weather, soak the pp connectors into the warm water for a few minutes, better for assembling. 【Buy with Confidence】Lifetime prompt customer service. 1 year free replacement for product quality issue.Your satisfaction is in the first place. Please make sure all the parts and instruction are included after receiving the product. Have any problem, please do not hesitate to contact with us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l4OXX2S2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROJASOP","source_asin":"B0BPB38MQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPB38MQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPB38MQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
