window.products.push({"id":1014870,"name":"Premium Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set by Delvina Electric Salt & Pepper -Pack Of 2 Mills- LED Light, Battery Operated Stainless Steel Grinders","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WmvWma7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEST SALT AND PEPPER ELECTRIC GRINDER: when we are sitting at the dinner table, going on a picnic or professionally prepare food in the kitchen or in a restaurant, we always want our food to have pleasant aromas of spices or it was deliciously salted. For this purpose we created a unique DelVina brand! These pepper mills are improved by electric motor and can grind for you: Himalayan salt, pepper corns, sweet pepper, red pepper and other fragrant and delicious seasonings. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: we understand how important the details are in appearance! Therefore, we chose food grade steel and food grade acrylic. These two environmentally friendly materials combined everything in a beautiful design that will not only be convenient to use, but will also greet you every day. High-quality steel will not rust and it always have a matte smooth silver hue. This design will be matched perfectly with your dishes. GRINDER ELECTRIC: salt and pepper electric mill sets DelVina, equipped with powerful mechanisms of these hand mills capacity of 8-10 ounces is excellent for grinding. DelVina wireless mills operate on battery using 6AAA batteries (not included) for each mile. The grinder itself is made from ceramics, which makes it possible to use the pepper mill for a very long time. EASY TO USE: we have considered that when you hold the grinder in your hand you should be comfortable to press the button, thanks to which you will drop the crushed precred. It is also convenient to fill pepper corn, which is 150 grams, which is enough for a long time in the use. In the lower part is the regulator of the possibility of setting the roughness of grinding and the expenditure of spices will give your food a fresh taste.Easily adjust the grinding setting by simply twisting the knob on the ends of the mill. Additional features include a base for precise seasoning, an acrylic viewing chamber to easily identify the contents as well as a sleek stainless housing which compliments any kitchen decor. GET IT TRUST: DelVina tries to monitor the quality of the produced salt and pepper mills sets, and we in turn guarantee a refund within 30 days. Instructions for use are on the box. On this you do not worry, buy and use the trust electric salt and pepper grinder set DelVina.The powerful, battery powered engine of these mills allow you to grind sea salt, black peppercorn, coriander, cumin seeds, paprika and more with unparalleled ease and safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WmvWma7CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon marketplace","source_asin":"B06WD8C3ZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WD8C3ZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WD8C3ZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
