window.products.push({"id":1014986,"name":"Carbon Line Brown on Black Sleek Design Gaming & Lifestyle Chair by RapidX","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dM6aTaCgL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Modeled after the comfortable feel of a luxurious sports car, the Carbon Line encourages you to indulge yourself in work and play. The classy, yet strong carbon fiber look is laced onto the bolsters and the rear of the chair. With five accent trims that complement the PVC leather and carbon fiber, our design will bring an upscale look to your office or gaming setup. From the Manufacturer Carbon fiber meets PVC leather The classy, yet strong carbon fiber look is laced onto the bolsters and the rear of the chair. With five accent trims that complement the PVC leather and carbon fiber, our design will bring an upscale look to your office or gaming setup. Customizable features With a reclining backrest ranging from 85-155 °, and a 5-position locking tilt seat, the Carbon Line is also suitable for rest and relaxation. The adjustable armrests and backrest can be customized to fit your needs in any situation. Indulge yourself Modeled after the comfortable feel of a luxurious sports car, the Carbon Line encourages you to indulge yourself in work and play. Sit back and relax in this wider, sturdier seat, supporting up to 350 pounds. Sit in the lap of luxury As you relax into your chair, you will feel the support of the dense polyurethane interior, relieving tension from your spine, neck, and shoulders by encouraging healthy posture. The orthopedic and ergonomic design promotes productivity when seated for extended periods, whether you are working or gaming. Feel supported Avoid back, neck, and shoulder pain associated with a long day of playing video games or sitting at your desk. Feel the support of the high backrest packed with dense polyurethane interior as you’re relaxing into your chair. The Specs • 20.8 inch black aluminum star base • 34.65 inch seat back height • 20.66 - 23.42 inch seat back width • 16.53 - 23.62 inch seat width • 22.83 inch seat length • 18.5 inch seat depth • Lift cylinder adjusts seat height from 20.27 - 22.83 inches • Armrests adjust from 11 - 14 inches in height • Supports up to 350 lbs About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Comfortable. Inspired. Adjustable. How did you come up with the idea for this product? The response to the our original extra large gaming and office chair was positive and inspiring. Many customers gave feedback that could not be ignored. Went back to the drawing board and designed an oversized lifestyle chair with the same aesthetic RapidX is known for. Carbon Line is the newest addition to the RapidX family of inspired lifestyle chairs. What makes your product special? RapidX made a conscious decision to rise above the norm of chair manufacturing. Prioritizing cost-effectiveness, a more mindful approach to materials, and design standards, allowed RapidX to develop the next generation of our product line. Unlike the costly and unattractive ergonomically designed chairs, RapidX’s chair lines look amazing and inspire your playful inner child. What has been the best part of your startup experience? The best part of the startup experience is witnessing the transformation from the concept to the finished product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dM6aTaCgL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RapidX","source_asin":"B075VP5QGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075VP5QGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075VP5QGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
