window.products.push({"id":1014988,"name":"BEYOND CREATION Rechargeable Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser, Touchless Foam Soap Dispenser with LED Display,Type-C Charging, IPX4 Waterproof, for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ciQfJMrDS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"[Advanced industrial design] BEYOND CREATION rechargeable automatic foaming soap dispenser has advanced industrial design to make it efficient and durable. Equipped with advanced sensors and motors, the foam can be produced in 0.25S, and the soft and dense foam makes the family fall in love with hand washing. [When the soap dispenser has a display] The new visual automatic soap dispenser is equipped with an elegant LED display, allowing the room temperature and battery power to be clear at a glance; a sensor button on the top, long touch for 3 seconds to turn on/off, short touch to switch between degrees Celsius and Fahrenheit. [Convenient, a newly designed soap tank] Fully open soap tank, forget the funnel, easy to operate. Transparent box design, know the remaining amount of soap at any time, convenient to add soap in time (320ml/10.82oz) [Rechargeable and waterproof] The soap dispenser is equipped with a 1500mAh rechargeable battery, supports type-C 3.0 fast charging, and can also be used while charging. (We have given away a charging cable in the box). A fully charged battery can last about 3 months. At the same time, it is made of durable high-quality waterproof materials and built-in rubber seals, with a waterproof rating of IPX4, ensuring its long-term use. [Choice of soap solution] We recommend refilling with foaming hand soap, which can be used directly. [Perfect after sale service let you no worries] We are committed to serving our customers with reliable products and empathetic service. Each product passed the quality inspection. You will get A 12 Months-Warranty for replacement. Please feel free to contact us if there is any problem.We will give you a satisfactory reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ciQfJMrDS._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEYOND CREATION","source_asin":"B09JXWKGBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1014988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JXWKGBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JXWKGBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
